# A delayed triggered ability is controlled by the player who controlled the spell that created it (CR 603.7d), wherever
# that spell has gone. Bot1's dashed Ragavan hits Bot2 and exiles the top of Bot2's library, Glimpse of Nature, which Bot1
# casts with the Treasure. The Glimpse resolves into its owner Bot2's graveyard (checked), but "you" in its "whenever you
# cast a creature spell this turn" is still Bot1: Bot1's Llanowar Elves draws Bot1 the Lightning Bolt on top of their library.
# (The dashed Ragavan goes back to Bot1's hand at the end step.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer
Llanowar Elves
Island
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Glimpse of Nature
Island x12

